rmediate"><addressbook><name>KASHIWABA, TADAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SASAKI, TADASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A core holding device and a cover device for roll-shaped label of a label sticking machine capable of assuredly holding a roll-shaped label or a core thereof, simplifying an operation for installation and removal thereof, and forming it simple and compact, characterized in that core holding members (core holding knob members (13)) for holding the roll-shaped label (L) are of a rotating type, each of the core holding members (13) is energized by a spring, a pair of spring plates (11) and the pair of core holding knob members (13) are installed between right and left side plates (3), each of the core holding knob members (13) comprises a rotating shaft part (20), a core holding part (21), and a knob part (22) which is located on the opposite side of the core holding part (21) and projected outward from the side plates (3), and the spring plates (11) can energize the core holding part (21) of each of the core holding knob members (13) in the core holding positional direction thereof.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un dispositif préhenseur de corps et son couvercle pour machine à coller des étiquettes enroulées permettant de saisir fermement les étiquettes enroulées ou leur corps pour les poser ou les retirer. Le dispositif, simple et compact, se caractérise par des boutons munis chacun d'un élément préhenseur (13) de corps, de type rotatif, actionnés par une paire de ressorts à lame (11), placés entre des joues latérales (3) gauche et droite, et comprenant chacun (13) un axe de pivotement (20), un préhenseur (21) de corps, et un bouton (22) opposé au préhenseur (21) de corps et dépassant des joues latérales (3) vers l'extérieur. Les ressorts à lame (11) rappellent l'élément préhenseur de chacun des boutons (13) en position de préhension du corps.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>